{
  "thought_summary": "首先需要确认目标测试文件是否存在并检查其内容，以了解测试的具体场景和预期行为。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "list_files",
    "arguments": {
      "path": "tests",
      "max_depth": 1,
      "max_entries": 10
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "确认目标测试文件存在，下一步需检查该测试文件的具体内容以了解其测试场景和预期行为。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "inspect_code",
    "arguments": {
      "file_path": "tests/test_find_first_in_sorted.py",
      "start_line": 1,
      "context_lines": 20,
      "max_lines": 50
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "测试文件确认存在，下一步需运行目标测试以验证 find_first_in_sorted 在目标值大于数组最大值时的行为。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "run_tests",
    "arguments": {
      "scope": "target"
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "目标测试失败，表明 find_first_in_sorted 在处理目标值大于数组最大值时可能引发索引越界错误。需要进一步调查 find_first_in_sorted 函数的实现以确认 mid 计算逻辑是否安全。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "inspect_code",
    "arguments": {
      "file_path": "find_first_in_sorted.py",
      "start_line": 1,
      "context_lines": 20,
      "max_lines": 50
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "发现 find_first_in_sorted 函数在处理目标值大于数组最大值时，hi 被初始化为 len(arr)，这可能导致 mid 计算超出数组索引范围。需要进一步验证 mid 计算逻辑是否在所有边界场景下安全。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "inspect_code",
    "arguments": {
      "file_path": "find_first_in_sorted.py",
      "start_line": 3,
      "context_lines": 10,
      "max_lines": 20
    }
  }
}
